sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant OrderService
  participant Order
  participant OrderItem
  participant NotificationService

  Note over Customer: Customer selects products and submits order information

  Customer->>OrderService: createOrder(customerId, recipientName, recipientPhone, deliveryAddress, items)

  alt Invalid input data (empty recipient or empty items)
    Note over OrderService: Validate required fields and product quantities
    OrderService-->>Customer: throw Error("Recipient and items cannot be empty")
  else Valid input data
    Note over OrderService: Instantiate Order and child OrderItems
    OrderService->>Order: new Order(orderId, customerId, recipientName, recipientPhone, deliveryAddress)
    loop For each item in request
      OrderService->>OrderItem: new OrderItem(itemId, orderId, productId, quantity)
    end

    Note over OrderService: Record initial status history
    OrderService->>Order: updateStatus("PENDING_CONFIRMATION", customerId)

    Note over OrderService: Persist order, order items and first status history together

    alt Save fails
      Note over OrderService: Roll back every step of the save, no order is stored
      OrderService-->>Customer: throw Error("Order could not be created") with reason
    else Save succeeds
      OrderService->>NotificationService: publishOrderStatusChanged(orderId, "", "PENDING_CONFIRMATION")
      Note over NotificationService: Broadcast real-time event to Admin dashboard

      OrderService-->>Customer: Order entity (status: PENDING_CONFIRMATION)
      Note over Customer: View newly created order confirmation on screen
    end
  end
